-- ===== 5) 听力 6篇/30题(audio_url 待 TTS) =====
DELETE FROM public.junior_listening_exercises WHERE volume='required1' AND unit='U2';
Tom: Hi, I''d like to book a flight to Lima next month.
Clerk: Sure. When would you like to leave?
Tom: On the fifteenth, in the morning if possible.
Clerk: There''s a flight at nine. It costs 600 dollars.
Tom: That''s fine. Do I need a visa for Peru?
Clerk: Yes, you should apply for one early.
Tom: OK, thank you very much.', 'Tom 想订下月去利马的机票;职员问出发日期,Tom 要15号上午;有班9点的、600美元;Tom 问秘鲁要不要签证,职员说要、且要早申请;Tom 道谢。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Where does Tom want to fly to?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Lima.","Paris.","London.","Tokyo."]},{"q":"When does Tom want to leave?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["On the fifth, at night.","On the fifteenth, in the morning.","Next week.","Today."]},{"q":"How much is the flight?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["600 dollars.","60 dollars.","1,600 dollars.","It''s free."]},{"q":"What does Tom ask about?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Where to eat.","Whether he needs a visa.","How to drive.","The hotel price."]},{"q":"What does the clerk advise about the visa?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Forget about it.","Buy it on the plane.","Apply for it early.","Ask the hotel."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U2');
We flew to Lima and then took a train into the mountains.
Our main destination was Machu Picchu, an ancient city of the Inca.
We hiked up a narrow path to reach it.
The view from the top was amazing, and I will never forget it.', '去年夏天我和家人去了秘鲁;先飞到利马,再坐火车进山;主要目的地是印加古城马丘比丘;我们沿狭窄小路爬上去;山顶的景色令人惊叹,我永远忘不了。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"When did the speaker visit Peru?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Last winter.","Last week.","Two years ago.","Last summer."]},{"q":"How did they get into the mountains?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["By train.","By boat.","On foot only.","By bike."]},{"q":"What was their main destination?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Lima airport.","Machu Picchu.","A beach.","A shopping mall."]},{"q":"How did they reach the ancient city?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["They drove a car.","They took a plane.","They hiked up a narrow path.","They swam across a river."]},{"q":"How did the speaker feel about the view?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It was boring.","It was frightening.","It was disappointing.","It was amazing and unforgettable."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required1', 'U2');
Clerk: Welcome. Yes, a room for three nights.
Guest: That''s right. Could I have a room with a view?
Clerk: Of course. Room 502 looks out over the lake.
Guest: Wonderful. What time is breakfast?
Clerk: From seven to nine in the morning.
Guest: Great. And when do we have to check out?
Clerk: Before noon on the last day. Here is your key.', '客人以 Green 的名字订了三晚;想要带景观的房间;职员给 502、能看到湖;问早餐时间,7点到9点;问几点退房,最后一天中午前;给钥匙。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"How many nights is the booking for?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Three nights.","One night.","Five nights.","Seven nights."]},{"q":"What kind of room does the guest ask for?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A room near the kitchen.","A room with a view.","The cheapest room.","A room with no windows."]},{"q":"What can the guest see from Room 502?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A car park.","A factory.","The lake.","Nothing."]},{"q":"When is breakfast served?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["All day.","Only at noon.","In the evening.","From seven to nine in the morning."]},{"q":"When must the guest check out?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Before noon on the last day.","At midnight.","Any time.","After three days of extra stay."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U2');
I like to walk slowly and enjoy the quiet of the mountains.
Hiking is good for my health and clears my mind.
Sometimes the path is steep and my bag feels heavy.
But the amazing views at the top are always worth it.', '我最喜欢的旅行方式是徒步;喜欢慢慢走、享受山里的宁静;徒步有益健康、能让头脑放空;有时路陡、背包很重;但山顶的美景总是值得的。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is the speaker''s favourite way to travel?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Flying.","Hiking.","Driving.","Sailing."]},{"q":"Why does the speaker like to walk slowly?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Because walking is hard.","To save money.","To enjoy the quiet of the mountains.","Because of the traffic."]},{"q":"What is one benefit of hiking the speaker mentions?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It costs a lot.","It is always easy.","It needs no walking.","It is good for health and the mind."]},{"q":"What does the speaker say can be difficult?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The steep path and heavy bag.","Finding a plane.","Speaking the language.","Booking a hotel."]},{"q":"What makes the difficulty worth it?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["The money saved.","The amazing views at the top.","The free food.","The short distance."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required1', 'U2');
Local: It''s not far. Walk straight along this street.
Visitor: And then?
Local: Turn left at the bank, and you''ll see a narrow path.
Visitor: Should I take a bus?
Local: No need. It''s only ten minutes on foot.
Visitor: Great. Thank you so much for your help.
Local: You''re welcome. Enjoy the view from the top!', '游客问怎么去古堡;当地人说不远,沿这条街直走;然后在银行左转,会看到一条窄路;游客问要不要坐公交,当地人说不用,步行只要十分钟;游客道谢,当地人让他好好欣赏山顶景色。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Where does the visitor want to go?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The airport.","The hospital.","The old castle.","The train station."]},{"q":"What should the visitor do at the bank?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Turn right.","Go back.","Wait for a bus.","Turn left."]},{"q":"Does the visitor need to take a bus?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["No, it''s only ten minutes on foot.","Yes, it''s very far.","Yes, there is no path.","Only at night."]},{"q":"How long does it take to walk there?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["About two hours.","About ten minutes.","A whole day.","Thirty seconds."]},{"q":"What does the local person wish the visitor?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["To buy a ticket.","To drive carefully.","To enjoy the view from the top.","To learn the language."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U2');
Before you leave, learn a few words of the local language.
Even just "hello" and "thank you" can make a big difference.
Local people are always pleased when visitors make the effort.
A few kind words often open the door to new friends.', '给爱旅行的人一个小贴士:出发前学几句当地语言;哪怕只是"你好"和"谢谢"也大不一样;当地人见到游客努力尝试总是很高兴;几句友善的话常能为你打开结识新朋友的大门。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is the tip about?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Buying cheap tickets.","Packing light.","Avoiding strangers.","Learning a few words of the local language."]},{"q":"Which words does the speaker give as examples?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["\"Hello\" and \"thank you\".","\"Yes\" and \"no\".","\"Stop\" and \"go\".","\"Up\" and \"down\"."]},{"q":"How do local people feel when visitors try?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Angry.","Pleased.","Bored.","Afraid."]},{"q":"What can a few kind words do?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Cost a lot of money.","Ruin the trip.","Help you make new friends.","Make people leave."]},{"q":"Who is this tip for?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only pilots.","Only children.","Only hotel workers.","Anyone who loves travelling."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required1', 'U2');

-- ===== 6) 写作 1篇(旅行邮件) =====
DELETE FROM public.junior_writing_prompts WHERE volume='required1' AND unit='U2';

How are you? I want to share an amazing trip with you. This summer my family and I travelled to Peru. We flew to Lima and then took a train into the mountains. We visited Machu Picchu, an ancient city of the Inca, and hiked up a narrow path to reach it. The view from the top was wonderful, and I will never forget it. I learned so much about the local culture and food. I really hope we can travel there together next time!

Yours,
Li Hua', '【15 分制】A 档(13-15):五要素齐全、组织有条理、语言准确多样;B 档(10-12):要点较全、少量错误;C 档(7-9):要点偏少、句型简单;D 档(0-6):内容不完整、错误多。', '["This summer my family and I travelled to Peru.","We flew to Lima and then took a train into the mountains.","The view from the top was wonderful, and I will never forget it.","I really hope we can travel there together next time!"]'::jsonb, '[{"wrong":"Last summer I go to Peru.","correct":"Last summer I went to Peru.","note":"叙述过去旅行用一般过去时 went。"},{"wrong":"We arrived to Lima in the morning.","correct":"We arrived in Lima in the morning.","note":"arrive in + 大地点(城市/国家),不用 arrive to。"},{"wrong":"The view was so amazing that I can''t forget it.","correct":"The view was so amazing that I couldn''t forget it.","note":"主句过去时,从句时态保持一致 couldn''t。"}]'::jsonb, '【旅行邮件结构】
第1步 称呼+开场:Dear Sam, … I want to share … trip.
第2步 去哪+怎么去:We travelled to … We got there by …
第3步 做了看了什么:We visited … and saw …
第4步 感受:It was … I''ll never forget …
第5步 邀请+落款:I hope we can go together next time. Yours, Li Hua', 2, 'required1', 'U2');

COMMIT;

